          "text": "Sales target is 50 million Euros in sales."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006a#5",
          "type": "decisions",
          "text": "Production cost should be half of the selling price."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006a#6",
          "type": "decisions",
          "text": "Phase one will be the functional design."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006a#7",
          "type": "decisions",
          "text": "Assume system for TV and video with potential future features."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006a#8",
          "type": "decisions",
          "text": "Product must be user-friendly."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006a#9",
          "type": "decisions",
          "text": "Product should have the least number of functions to simplify usage."
        },
